## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** Unattributed free model endpoint on OpenCode Zen, offered for a limited time while its team collects feedback and improves the model. No vendor, architecture, or release announcement is publicly identified.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen only — ID `exo-free` (OpenCode config form `opencode/exo-free`), Chat Completions API at `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`. Verified present in the Zen docs model table and the live `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/models` listing (fetched 2026-10-09).
- **Release / knowledge:** no public release date or knowledge cutoff published.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free`; no Free ID distinction (the endpoint itself is the free tier).
- **Context window:** no verified public value found.
- **Modalities:** no verified public value found (endpoint is text chat completions; image/audio support undocumented).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-09):** Free ($0 in/out/cached) per the Zen pricing table. Privacy caveat per Zen docs: "During its free period, collected data may be used to improve the model."
- **Architecture:** no verified public information — parameter count, architecture, and license are all undisclosed.

